  "recipeCuisine": "Italy",
  "name": "Pesto",
  "text": "Pesto\n\nPreparation Time: 5 minutes\n\nCooking time: 0 minutes\n\nYield: 4\n\nIngredients\n\n50 g (2 oz) basil (including stalks),\n\n50 g (2 oz) pine nuts,\n\n65 g (2 1/2 oz) Parmesan cheese (freshly grated),\n\n2 cloves of garlic (chopped),\n\n125 ml (4 fl oz) olive oil,\n\nsalt and pepper.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Tear the basil into pieces and put into a food processor with the pine nuts, Parmesan and garlic.\n\n2. Blend lightly in the food processor until the nuts and cheese are broken into small pieces, scraping the mixture down from the sides of the bowl if necessary.\n\n3. Add the olive oil and a little salt and blend to a thick paste.\n\nNotes\n\nCan be kept in a lidded jar for up to 5 days.",
  "prepTime": "PT5M",
